INSERT INTO activity_events VALUES(761,'Sync','Shopify daily sync','Shopify daily sync 2026-11-20 07:46 EET (store: Zyra Care, zyra-care.com, EGP). Trailing 7 days (13–20 Nov): 3 orders, net revenue 2,337 EGP, AOV 779 EGP. Yesterday 19 Nov: 0 orders; today so far: 0 — within normal range at 0.43 orders/day avg, no sudden drop. KP routine 2/3 orders (1,398 EGP, 59.8% of revenue); Cellulite Routine 0. All 3 buyers repeat customers (100%). Top pair: سكراب جلد الوزة + Signature scent routine (939 EGP, #1915) — 61 EGP short of the 1,000 EGP free-shipping threshold. All 3 orders used code 100OFF (300 EGP total discounts); KP list price verified at 799 EGP, so the 699 EGP paid is the discount, not a price mismatch. All 3 orders PENDING (COD). Snapshot id 2 recorded.',1795153675673);
